name scrwfile
category Package
revision 66872
shortdesc Use LaTeX .aux file in place of \newrite files
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides a means of sending all LaTeX \newrite,
longdesc table of contents, and other miscellaneous output via the LaTeX
longdesc .aux file. The mechanism subverts the mechanism of \newrite,
longdesc and means there will never be a "No room for new \write"
longdesc message.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/scrwfile/scrwfile.sty
catalogue-also morewrites rvwrite
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/komascript/scrwfile
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/komascript/scrwfile.git
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/scrwfile
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics io-mgmt
catalogue-version 0.1.99
